 of China. It is located in the Datong Basin at an elevation of 1,040 metres (3,410 ft) and borders Inner Mongolia to the north and west and Hebei to the east. As of the 2020 census, it had a population of 3,105,591 of whom 1,790,452 lived in the built-up area made of the 2 out 4 urban districts of Pingcheng and Yungang as Yunzhou and Xinrong are not conurbated yet.","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0e/Datong_Ancient_City_Wall_%2854578074197%29.jpg/330px-Datong_Ancient_City_Wall_%2854578074197%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Datong"},"twins":["Q385623","Q47822"],"climate":{"temp":[-9.7,-5.1,1.7,9.2,16.2,21.4,23.7,21.7,15.9,8,-0.6,-8.3],"rain":[2,5,9,22,36,61,103,88,65,26,11,2],"cloud":[46,48,45,51,53,61,59,54,51,38,37,41]},"land":true}